      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Best friend Squad Rides Again III - the cash grab sequel</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Bow is planning his surprice for Glimmers 40th birthday.&lt;br /&gt;Glimmer must find out what it is, so help her titan.&lt;br /&gt;Mermista is of no help.&lt;br /&gt;Scorpia is a little too eager to help.&lt;br /&gt;Adora is a mess.&lt;br /&gt;Catra shows no mercy.&lt;br /&gt;There might be a carchase.&lt;br /&gt;There might be cake.&lt;br /&gt;There WILL be... THE CRAWLER!!!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
